# ==============================================================
# FRONTEND CLIENT ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (.env.example)
# ==============================================================
# In local development:
# Point to your local Node/Express backend running on port 5000:
#VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000

# In production on Vercel:
# Set this in your Vercel project settings to your deployed backend URL:
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.vercel.app
#
# IMPORTANT NOTICE:
# In Vite, all environment variables prefixed with VITE_ are embedded into
# the client-side JavaScript bundle during the build.
# NEVER place database connection strings, JWT secrets, or private keys here!
